(3934998, 558595, 56828, '<td valign="top">To be honest when I see this photo, I don''t really see an emotion.  It looks more to me as an out of focus photo.  There may be something specially emotional about this ballet formation, but as someone who doesn''t really know ballet I wouldn''t understand the emotion.</td>', 'To be honest when I see this photo, I don''t really see an emotion.  It looks more to me as an out of focus photo.  There may be something specially emotional about this ballet formation, but as someone who doesn''t really know ballet I wouldn''t understand the emotion.', '2007-07-25 09:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3935002, 560316, 56828, '<td valign="top">Love the focus.  Way to stop the action in mid air.</td>', 'Love the focus.  Way to stop the action in mid air.', '2007-07-25 09:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3935008, 560047, 56828, '<td valign="top">Not voting this DNMC.  But by virtue of placing your subjects face in the top third intersection point, you put the face as the main focus.  So immdiately when I look at the shot, I look at the face.<br/> <br/>Technically, I like the tight composition.  I like that you placed your subject in the third spot.  The color of the water really stands out..</td>', 'Not voting this DNMC.  But by virtue of placing your subjects face in the top third intersection point, you put the face as the main focus.  So immdiately when I look at the shot, I look at the face. Technically, I like the tight composition.  I like that you placed your subject in the third spot.  The color of the water really stands out..', '2007-07-25 09:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3935011, 560277, 70689, '<td valign="top">although the face is a minor part of the picture, I feel that the emotion part of it heavily depends on the face, as the body does not express much emotion. Should we delete the face (which I do in case of doubt), we would not have much emotion left in the picture.</td>', 'although the face is a minor part of the picture, I feel that the emotion part of it heavily depends on the face, as the body does not express much emotion. Should we delete the face (which I do in case of doubt), we would not have much emotion left in the picture.', '2007-07-25 09:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
