(3935037, 560409, 56828, '<td valign="top">Aww...you have one kid who just couldn''t resist looking at the camera...lol.  I really like the photo.  Although I am slightly confused and I really hope not to offend anyone, but the arm with the ring on it, looks like it would be coming from the expecting mother...but it looks like a man''s arm.  The crop might just be slightly too tight.</td>', 'Aww...you have one kid who just couldn''t resist looking at the camera...lol.  I really like the photo.  Although I am slightly confused and I really hope not to offend anyone, but the arm with the ring on it, looks like it would be coming from the expecting mother...but it looks like a man''s arm.  The crop might just be slightly too tight.', '2007-07-25 09:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3935046, 560418, 76585, '<td valign="top">I love the color and the tilt of the camera on this one! You''ve done a great gob showing  passion here without exposing the face. Great work!10</td>', 'I love the color and the tilt of the camera on this one! You''ve done a great gob showing  passion here without exposing the face. Great work!10', '2007-07-25 09:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
