(3936547, 558598, 56828, '<td valign="top">Your flash is too bright which makes this look more like a snapshot in the bar...especially since you have the guys in the background.  Your foocus for this shot has become the woman laughing (with the face).  You did htis in two ways....one by covering only one girl with her hair...the other woman became the only thing that was recognizable and that is where your eyes drift to.  Secondly, you placed her on the let third of the photo....which is one of your focus points.<br/> <br/>Other things to note is that the beer bottles (especially the one right in front, distract from the photo and so does the cup on the right.</td>', 'Your flash is too bright which makes this look more like a snapshot in the bar...especially since you have the guys in the background.  Your foocus for this shot has become the woman laughing (with the face).  You did htis in two ways....one by covering only one girl with her hair...the other woman became the only thing that was recognizable and that is where your eyes drift to.  Secondly, you placed her on the let third of the photo....which is one of your focus points. Other things to note is that the beer bottles (especially the one right in front, distract from the photo and so does the cup on the right.', '2007-07-25 16:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
