(3938180, 560400, 60862, '<td valign="top">What emotion did you intend to convey here?</td>', 'What emotion did you intend to convey here?', '2007-07-26 00:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938183, 559694, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting the emotional connection here.  War is certainly an emotional subject, but this is a picture of a peaceful scene.</td>', 'I''m not getting the emotional connection here.  War is certainly an emotional subject, but this is a picture of a peaceful scene.', '2007-07-26 00:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938227, 559561, 33672, '<td valign="top">Outstanding! Great POV and emotion.</td>', 'Outstanding! Great POV and emotion.', '2007-07-26 00:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938231, 559987, 33672, '<td valign="top">Too Funny but very emotive...</td>', 'Too Funny but very emotive...', '2007-07-26 00:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938235, 560552, 33672, '<td valign="top">Too funny... Great idea.</td>', 'Too funny... Great idea.', '2007-07-26 00:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938363, 560543, 41047, '<td valign="top">LOL, awesome colleen. i love the smiley face on the tree :D</td>', 'LOL, awesome colleen. i love the smiley face on the tree :D', '2007-07-26 01:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938398, 559561, 81082, '<td valign="top">Great perspective &amp; capture of the headbang.</td>', 'Great perspective & capture of the headbang.', '2007-07-26 01:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938401, 559807, 81082, '<td valign="top">Creative, comical subjct matter.</td>', 'Creative, comical subjct matter.', '2007-07-26 01:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938405, 560015, 81082, '<td valign="top">Adorable and very creative! I like everything - lighting, pose, and the scars on the bananas.</td>', 'Adorable and very creative! I like everything - lighting, pose, and the scars on the bananas.', '2007-07-26 01:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938415, 560464, 81082, '<td valign="top">Very powerful. The overwhelming size of the cleaver and the strength in the hand holding it work very well. The only thing you might have done differently is move the glass more to the left - in its present placement, the cleaver juts directly against its curve, and it''s a little strange to the eye (because it almost like the cleaver is touching the glass). Bur great picture! It resonates with me. Thanks for sharing it.</td>', 'Very powerful. The overwhelming size of the cleaver and the strength in the hand holding it work very well. The only thing you might have done differently is move the glass more to the left - in its present placement, the cleaver juts directly against its curve, and it''s a little strange to the eye (because it almost like the cleaver is touching the glass). Bur great picture! It resonates with me. Thanks for sharing it.', '2007-07-26 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938416, 560426, 81082, '<td valign="top">Great picture - I can totally relate. You captured the perfect focus/perspective.</td>', 'Great picture - I can totally relate. You captured the perfect focus/perspective.', '2007-07-26 02:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938422, 560257, 81082, '<td valign="top">Those windows are a great find. I hope you use them again (if you haven''t already).</td>', 'Those windows are a great find. I hope you use them again (if you haven''t already).', '2007-07-26 02:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938429, 560409, 81082, '<td valign="top">I really like that you showed just one half of one of the children''s face. You showed great restraint (I have no way of knowing, but it might have been tempting to show more of the face or more faces) and it works so well. Her eyes convey enough for everyone.</td>', 'I really like that you showed just one half of one of the children''s face. You showed great restraint (I have no way of knowing, but it might have been tempting to show more of the face or more faces) and it works so well. Her eyes convey enough for everyone.', '2007-07-26 02:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938432, 559977, 81082, '<td valign="top">You perfectly captured the word "languid." Very nice.</td>', 'You perfectly captured the word "languid." Very nice.', '2007-07-26 02:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938440, 560333, 81082, '<td valign="top">I think the picture would have worked even better without the perfectly posed knife. The knife makes the picture a bit trite. Despair is conveyed aptly though the man''s posture and the construction of the room (crumbling as it is). Just a thought! I definitely like the picture though - great setting.</td>', 'I think the picture would have worked even better without the perfectly posed knife. The knife makes the picture a bit trite. Despair is conveyed aptly though the man''s posture and the construction of the room (crumbling as it is). Just a thought! I definitely like the picture though - great setting.', '2007-07-26 02:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938447, 559731, 81082, '<td valign="top">Great placement of the couple and use of perspective! I love this picture.</td>', 'Great placement of the couple and use of perspective! I love this picture.', '2007-07-26 02:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938449, 558964, 81082, '<td valign="top">Wow - I''m impressed. Love the contrast so evident even "without" color.</td>', 'Wow - I''m impressed. Love the contrast so evident even "without" color.', '2007-07-26 02:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
