(3938827, 560329, 74078, '<td valign="top">Nice work. A lot of effort has clearly gone into this one. I like the idea. The only thing that springs to mind on the negative for this one is that the model hand looks to be of a young teen (male) which would hopefully not fit into a cheating gambler situation. I do like the work done on this one though and think that it deserves a minimum of 9 pushing 10.</td>', 'Nice work. A lot of effort has clearly gone into this one. I like the idea. The only thing that springs to mind on the negative for this one is that the model hand looks to be of a young teen (male) which would hopefully not fit into a cheating gambler situation. I do like the work done on this one though and think that it deserves a minimum of 9 pushing 10.', '2007-07-26 08:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938831, 560015, 74078, '<td valign="top">Awesome work. Very creative, nice work in setting this one up. Not sure what the bottom of the left banana is representing :) but love the ''hand over the shoulder'' creation. Good background/setting and lighting. 10 and I will have to consider giving up membership if this doesn''t hit on a ribbon.</td>', 'Awesome work. Very creative, nice work in setting this one up. Not sure what the bottom of the left banana is representing :) but love the ''hand over the shoulder'' creation. Good background/setting and lighting. 10 and I will have to consider giving up membership if this doesn''t hit on a ribbon.', '2007-07-26 08:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
