(3938901, 558717, 18073, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  The model fits the bill nicely and the grungy look suits the image too.  I am not too sure about the lighting though, although I can''t quite put my finger on the problem.  I think maybe the walls are little bit too bright.  Nice image all the same though, well done.</td>', 'Nice image.  The model fits the bill nicely and the grungy look suits the image too.  I am not too sure about the lighting though, although I can''t quite put my finger on the problem.  I think maybe the walls are little bit too bright.  Nice image all the same though, well done.', '2007-07-26 09:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3938910, 559018, 18073, '<td valign="top">A fine image.  I like the overall tone of the image and the motion blur really adds to the mood and seems to increase the sense of distress.  Nice job!</td>', 'A fine image.  I like the overall tone of the image and the motion blur really adds to the mood and seems to increase the sense of distress.  Nice job!', '2007-07-26 09:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
