(3939106, 559050, 66348, '<td valign="top">What no suicide picture?? Ok by far the BEST of the challenge. My pic for the blue ribbon. I love your take on the challenge. Think positive, don''t kill yourself, or show depression, but rejoice in life and in love. You portrayed that beautifully. I love the jump feet kicker pose thingy you pulled off. The sharpness and composition is right on. Colors are great. I mean everything about this says blue. Not a big fan of the bigger borders but even that works in your shot. Only thing I''m upset about is that I can only give you a 10!! Congrats on a wonderful shot.</td>', 'What no suicide picture?? Ok by far the BEST of the challenge. My pic for the blue ribbon. I love your take on the challenge. Think positive, don''t kill yourself, or show depression, but rejoice in life and in love. You portrayed that beautifully. I love the jump feet kicker pose thingy you pulled off. The sharpness and composition is right on. Colors are great. I mean everything about this says blue. Not a big fan of the bigger borders but even that works in your shot. Only thing I''m upset about is that I can only give you a 10!! Congrats on a wonderful shot.', '2007-07-26 10:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
