(3941595, 560317, 35274, '<td valign="top">Gee wiz, I wonder who will win the blue? *cough cough*<br/>Really, this is just perfect. I think the beautiful focusing you have achieved here definitely makes this superior. And of course, the tonal range, the sharpness, the splendid backdrop. You get the idea :P</td>', 'Gee wiz, I wonder who will win the blue? *cough cough*Really, this is just perfect. I think the beautiful focusing you have achieved here definitely makes this superior. And of course, the tonal range, the sharpness, the splendid backdrop. You get the idea :P', '2007-07-27 01:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
