(3941742, 559475, 39243, '<td valign="top">ooops thats a face i can see -hmmmm....I am really not sure how to score this one- he definitly has emotion but alas the face... I will give you a 5 since i don''t know how to score ya</td>', 'ooops thats a face i can see -hmmmm....I am really not sure how to score this one- he definitly has emotion but alas the face... I will give you a 5 since i don''t know how to score ya', '2007-07-27 02:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941746, 560307, 39243, '<td valign="top">i am pretty sure i can see her face - you know i have scored every photo in the challenge and I went to the forums to see what people were saying about faceless and it is mixed - so since that is the case I am scoring anything with a face a 5 since i can''t omit my vote - nothing about the photography - it is quite a nice photo - just not sure how to score it. good luck</td>', 'i am pretty sure i can see her face - you know i have scored every photo in the challenge and I went to the forums to see what people were saying about faceless and it is mixed - so since that is the case I am scoring anything with a face a 5 since i can''t omit my vote - nothing about the photography - it is quite a nice photo - just not sure how to score it. good luck', '2007-07-27 02:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941813, 560324, 22301, '<td valign="top">A very calming image but I don''t find this personally an extreme emotion. I like the color in the photo from what appears to be a foggy day. a nice Dof field also helps with the seclusion you were trying to exude.</td>', 'A very calming image but I don''t find this personally an extreme emotion. I like the color in the photo from what appears to be a foggy day. a nice Dof field also helps with the seclusion you were trying to exude.', '2007-07-27 03:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941820, 558667, 22301, '<td valign="top">I feel like their is an anticipation I can feel coming from the ride. I enjoy the colors and silhouettes but think perhaps it would have been stronger without the person on the right who is not on the ride. reminds me of childhood. :)</td>', 'I feel like their is an anticipation I can feel coming from the ride. I enjoy the colors and silhouettes but think perhaps it would have been stronger without the person on the right who is not on the ride. reminds me of childhood. :)', '2007-07-27 03:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941823, 560104, 22301, '<td valign="top">funny idea, the penguin is a little hairy though :)<br/>I like the use of the flash to keep the entire photo from being a silhouette in the foreground</td>', 'funny idea, the penguin is a little hairy though :)I like the use of the flash to keep the entire photo from being a silhouette in the foreground', '2007-07-27 03:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941828, 559751, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the highlights in the hair. I think a partial desaturation would have worked a little better but that is my personal preference, or complete B&amp;W, but I do understand what you were trying to accomplish. Usually I don''t like frames but this one suits the photo.</td>', 'I like the highlights in the hair. I think a partial desaturation would have worked a little better but that is my personal preference, or complete B&W, but I do understand what you were trying to accomplish. Usually I don''t like frames but this one suits the photo.', '2007-07-27 03:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941833, 560293, 22301, '<td valign="top">the slight motion blur adds a nice depth, a very good studio shot but I wish the lighting was more even as the top of the ground appears a little darker the the bottom right. this photo has some good leading lines and composition as well, my eye is drawn to the impact.</td>', 'the slight motion blur adds a nice depth, a very good studio shot but I wish the lighting was more even as the top of the ground appears a little darker the the bottom right. this photo has some good leading lines and composition as well, my eye is drawn to the impact.', '2007-07-27 03:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941845, 560550, 22301, '<td valign="top">as i look through the photos in this challenge I wonder what each person''s definition of an extreme emotion is. For me Bliss is not but perhaps to you it is. To me this photo needs a little more contrast, shadows and darker areas are a bit too bright. I also wonder why these two sat behind the tree, it seems like they couldn''t see the water fall clearly. :) It looks like a great little hide away. Just my opinion, I am not voting just commenting.<br/>Joe</td>', 'as i look through the photos in this challenge I wonder what each person''s definition of an extreme emotion is. For me Bliss is not but perhaps to you it is. To me this photo needs a little more contrast, shadows and darker areas are a bit too bright. I also wonder why these two sat behind the tree, it seems like they couldn''t see the water fall clearly. :) It looks like a great little hide away. Just my opinion, I am not voting just commenting.Joe', '2007-07-27 03:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941853, 558852, 22301, '<td valign="top">I am sure by now you have 18 comments telling you you put a face in a faceless challenge so I will leave that alone. The black and white conversion is really nice and the tones work well. This appears to have been a small crop as it is abit noisy, not that that isn''t what you were going for but what I see when I first look. From a composition standpoint my eye is drawn to the ear and nose from rule of thirds where the thirds cross thats what i focus on. however there does seem to be a lot of emotion in the statue.</td>', 'I am sure by now you have 18 comments telling you you put a face in a faceless challenge so I will leave that alone. The black and white conversion is really nice and the tones work well. This appears to have been a small crop as it is abit noisy, not that that isn''t what you were going for but what I see when I first look. From a composition standpoint my eye is drawn to the ear and nose from rule of thirds where the thirds cross thats what i focus on. however there does seem to be a lot of emotion in the statue.', '2007-07-27 03:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941857, 559411, 22301, '<td valign="top">very strong image, I like the use of lighting here and I really like the see through reflections of the memorial, also the top line of the memorial leads me into the faces of the two individuals. Real good use of lines. I think this will do well, good work. a small part of me feels like this is a bit set up but I am not voting anyways. even if set up it still is a good example of what the challenge wanted.</td>', 'very strong image, I like the use of lighting here and I really like the see through reflections of the memorial, also the top line of the memorial leads me into the faces of the two individuals. Real good use of lines. I think this will do well, good work. a small part of me feels like this is a bit set up but I am not voting anyways. even if set up it still is a good example of what the challenge wanted.', '2007-07-27 03:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941859, 558304, 22301, '<td valign="top">real simple and effective, I hope not too many say you can see the face and you are scoring well. I like how the emotion is left up to the viewer and not explicitly fed to us. one of my favorites so far.</td>', 'real simple and effective, I hope not too many say you can see the face and you are scoring well. I like how the emotion is left up to the viewer and not explicitly fed to us. one of my favorites so far.', '2007-07-27 03:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941869, 558545, 22301, '<td valign="top">oh man there is faces all over but I am sure(you know and have been told this over and over again) :). As an image seperate from the challenge I like it, I see similarities in the positions of the Raptor and protector and that pleases me. I really like all the details in the feathers. If I had one critique is that the white seem to have a very slight tint of cyan, but that could be me and I am nitpicking. I really wonder what could be going on off screen that would make the handler look so surprised while holding an eagle.<br/>Joe</td>', 'oh man there is faces all over but I am sure(you know and have been told this over and over again) :). As an image seperate from the challenge I like it, I see similarities in the positions of the Raptor and protector and that pleases me. I really like all the details in the feathers. If I had one critique is that the white seem to have a very slight tint of cyan, but that could be me and I am nitpicking. I really wonder what could be going on off screen that would make the handler look so surprised while holding an eagle.Joe', '2007-07-27 03:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941872, 560326, 22301, '<td valign="top">cool, like the Wizard of Oz! if I had one critique it would be to look at your levels, it seems to not really really have a true white and I think brightening up would have really helped this shot. That is my only critique though, the idea and composition are great. Feel free to PM me if you want me to show you what I mean :)</td>', 'cool, like the Wizard of Oz! if I had one critique it would be to look at your levels, it seems to not really really have a true white and I think brightening up would have really helped this shot. That is my only critique though, the idea and composition are great. Feel free to PM me if you want me to show you what I mean :)', '2007-07-27 03:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941874, 558591, 22301, '<td valign="top">I wonder what they are looking at. I don''t know if I would qualify this as an extreme emotion but this a great family candid for a family album. :)</td>', 'I wonder what they are looking at. I don''t know if I would qualify this as an extreme emotion but this a great family candid for a family album. :)', '2007-07-27 03:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941878, 560515, 22301, '<td valign="top">This has to be two people!  I like it, think an S-curve using curves would have added some more contrast to make the photo pop. Reminds me of doing crazy things as a kid with that great childhood friend. :)</td>', 'This has to be two people!  I like it, think an S-curve using curves would have added some more contrast to make the photo pop. Reminds me of doing crazy things as a kid with that great childhood friend. :)', '2007-07-27 03:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941882, 559410, 22301, '<td valign="top">I really like the image, it feels like a dream for sure. But I feel no emotion from the two people in the photo. Perhaps I miss it. I really like the red tones, it makes me feel like the heat has withered away their own protection from the sun. very interesting photo.</td>', 'I really like the image, it feels like a dream for sure. But I feel no emotion from the two people in the photo. Perhaps I miss it. I really like the red tones, it makes me feel like the heat has withered away their own protection from the sun. very interesting photo.', '2007-07-27 04:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941888, 560293, 69368, '<td valign="top">:-) very nice idea!</td>', ':-) very nice idea!', '2007-07-27 04:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941893, 558275, 69368, '<td valign="top">beautiful scenery. nice idea, good lighting, the b+w works well</td>', 'beautiful scenery. nice idea, good lighting, the b+w works well', '2007-07-27 04:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941899, 559270, 22301, '<td valign="top">A good photo of grief but the tilt to the right is makes me want to keep tilting my head as I look at it. Although I could understand that it may not be straight also. I really like the details in the cross and the photo appears with a slightly muted color scheme which makes me feel the disconnect the mourner would be going through.</td>', 'A good photo of grief but the tilt to the right is makes me want to keep tilting my head as I look at it. Although I could understand that it may not be straight also. I really like the details in the cross and the photo appears with a slightly muted color scheme which makes me feel the disconnect the mourner would be going through.', '2007-07-27 04:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941909, 560284, 22301, '<td valign="top">This has great color and the poor guy appears to be getting beaten down in a hurry! I couldn''t decide between what I think is an extreme emotion, or action so I am not voting just commenting but I think this photo definitely has both, for this guy I am sure it was all intense. The stop action really adds to this moment too.</td>', 'This has great color and the poor guy appears to be getting beaten down in a hurry! I couldn''t decide between what I think is an extreme emotion, or action so I am not voting just commenting but I think this photo definitely has both, for this guy I am sure it was all intense. The stop action really adds to this moment too.', '2007-07-27 04:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941923, 559814, 22301, '<td valign="top">I am no CSI but I would expect more blood :P<br/>A nice set up shot and definitely tells a story but seems a little fake to feel extreme. Of course would I really want to see a shot that the victim appears to actually shot? Please excuse my ramblings I am not voting just commenting on the images. Maybe some detail in the dead man''s hands would have added to the tale and give a reason for the viewer to wonder why the death.<br/>joe</td>', 'I am no CSI but I would expect more blood :PA nice set up shot and definitely tells a story but seems a little fake to feel extreme. Of course would I really want to see a shot that the victim appears to actually shot? Please excuse my ramblings I am not voting just commenting on the images. Maybe some detail in the dead man''s hands would have added to the tale and give a reason for the viewer to wonder why the death.joe', '2007-07-27 04:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941929, 559987, 61755, '<td valign="top">One of the better images I have seen in this challenge!</td>', 'One of the better images I have seen in this challenge!', '2007-07-27 04:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941938, 558228, 22301, '<td valign="top">cool frame, I wonder if it is someone or herself who she has lost patience in. I really like the scene and how her head is just touching the horizon. I would think if it is someone she has no patience for anymore she is deciding what to do and has not done it yet. She is not bloody and I figured she would put that hair band on her wrist in her hair to keep it out of her face during the murderous rampage, unless of course its just a back up. :P</td>', 'cool frame, I wonder if it is someone or herself who she has lost patience in. I really like the scene and how her head is just touching the horizon. I would think if it is someone she has no patience for anymore she is deciding what to do and has not done it yet. She is not bloody and I figured she would put that hair band on her wrist in her hair to keep it out of her face during the murderous rampage, unless of course its just a back up. :P', '2007-07-27 04:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941960, 560328, 14986, '<td valign="top">I know what you mean! My daughter finished the book early morning, 3 days after the release.</td>', 'I know what you mean! My daughter finished the book early morning, 3 days after the release.', '2007-07-27 04:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941987, 559879, 22301, '<td valign="top">Its an interesting photo and in a photo like this its all in the details. For me I assume the photo was a gift, but the photo seems pretty formal and more of a headshot which makes me think maybe the the person on the other end got sick of their vanity. To me the blood seem to placed, if they had stabbed the person there wold be more than just a few drops and splatters on the end of the knife. For a set up like this I like to see it over the top. The lighting you used is really well done and the shadows are really soft and I like that there is no glare on the photo.</td>', 'Its an interesting photo and in a photo like this its all in the details. For me I assume the photo was a gift, but the photo seems pretty formal and more of a headshot which makes me think maybe the the person on the other end got sick of their vanity. To me the blood seem to placed, if they had stabbed the person there wold be more than just a few drops and splatters on the end of the knife. For a set up like this I like to see it over the top. The lighting you used is really well done and the shadows are really soft and I like that there is no glare on the photo.', '2007-07-27 05:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941992, 560317, 22301, '<td valign="top">nice hops :)<br/>a nice portrait and DoF, although I get the emotion it doesn''t feel so extreme. But one person''s extreme may not be another''s...<br/>I like the idea of the balloons but if they had more color I think it would have been better. everything else is well done, nice and crisp.</td>', 'nice hops :)a nice portrait and DoF, although I get the emotion it doesn''t feel so extreme. But one person''s extreme may not be another''s...I like the idea of the balloons but if they had more color I think it would have been better. everything else is well done, nice and crisp.', '2007-07-27 05:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3942004, 558764, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the tilt too. This is a tough one, I am sure the driver is concentrating but it seems hard get the whole feeling, just my opinion not to worry I am not voting :). In a lot of cases I think breaking the rule of thirds works but in this time I think it may have helped to atleast not have the head centered. Kudos though for coming up with a photo that faces forward, not backlit and still able to show emotion.</td>', 'I like the idea and the tilt too. This is a tough one, I am sure the driver is concentrating but it seems hard get the whole feeling, just my opinion not to worry I am not voting :). In a lot of cases I think breaking the rule of thirds works but in this time I think it may have helped to atleast not have the head centered. Kudos though for coming up with a photo that faces forward, not backlit and still able to show emotion.', '2007-07-27 06:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3942005, 557369, 22301, '<td valign="top">I saw this one somewhere around here for a sec, but can''t remember whose it was. I really like it as a portrait and hope it doesn''t get to shot down for showing some face. The black and white works perfectly and all her body language seems to show how she really feels about the hand me down. excellent.</td>', 'I saw this one somewhere around here for a sec, but can''t remember whose it was. I really like it as a portrait and hope it doesn''t get to shot down for showing some face. The black and white works perfectly and all her body language seems to show how she really feels about the hand me down. excellent.', '2007-07-27 06:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3942006, 558688, 22301, '<td valign="top">I would think you would plug the electric guitar in, no? :P<br/>This has great lighting and the outfit is nice too, it feels a little cramped but maybe that is symbolic of the man trying to keep punk down.</td>', 'I would think you would plug the electric guitar in, no? :PThis has great lighting and the outfit is nice too, it feels a little cramped but maybe that is symbolic of the man trying to keep punk down.', '2007-07-27 06:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3942007, 558275, 22301, '<td valign="top">This is the first person in nature shot that really seems to exude alot of emotion for me. I think it comes form the framing and how as the tree opens up there the figure really taking it all in. Maybe its because I connect with living by the ocean, either way it works for me.</td>', 'This is the first person in nature shot that really seems to exude alot of emotion for me. I think it comes form the framing and how as the tree opens up there the figure really taking it all in. Maybe its because I connect with living by the ocean, either way it works for me.', '2007-07-27 06:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3942008, 560531, 22301, '<td valign="top">I think the ! takes away from the somber mood of the photo abit. "hard day" to me keeps it simple and complements the photo more. The sungle source lighting really works for this photo and the negative space leaves alot of the emotion up to the viewer.</td>', 'I think the ! takes away from the somber mood of the photo abit. "hard day" to me keeps it simple and complements the photo more. The sungle source lighting really works for this photo and the negative space leaves alot of the emotion up to the viewer.', '2007-07-27 06:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3942013, 559716, 22301, '<td valign="top">A very nice action shot, is it extreme emotion tough? I am sure for the driver it is. :) I am only commenting not voting as there were too many for me to decide what was and what wasn''t extreme emotion. As a photo outside this challenge I like this photo but the color balance seems to be off for me. The greens seem too bright. I would also make sure to try and use the whole allotment of 150 kb as a size limit, it will help with the small details and keep them smooth. Great timing on this one to get the car mid''wreck. You seem to be close by too so i am glad your alright!</td>', 'A very nice action shot, is it extreme emotion tough? I am sure for the driver it is. :) I am only commenting not voting as there were too many for me to decide what was and what wasn''t extreme emotion. As a photo outside this challenge I like this photo but the color balance seems to be off for me. The greens seem too bright. I would also make sure to try and use the whole allotment of 150 kb as a size limit, it will help with the small details and keep them smooth. Great timing on this one to get the car mid''wreck. You seem to be close by too so i am glad your alright!', '2007-07-27 06:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3942014, 560329, 22301, '<td valign="top">nice! I like lots of emotion and great blood/knife work good luck in the challenge. I also like how the hand of the stabbed is facing up as if stuck into the table. :)</td>', 'nice! I like lots of emotion and great blood/knife work good luck in the challenge. I also like how the hand of the stabbed is facing up as if stuck into the table. :)', '2007-07-27 06:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3942015, 560092, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like it, its like a bad dream with quick flashes of light, The shadow across the chest is just right as it comes across the tshirt.</td>', 'I like it, its like a bad dream with quick flashes of light, The shadow across the chest is just right as it comes across the tshirt.', '2007-07-27 06:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3942018, 560257, 22301, '<td valign="top">To me it seems like she is about to be caged and getting her last look at freedom. I am obviously not married LoL. <br/>IMO the sky being so blown brings the shot down. I think underexposing more to have some detail in the sky would have helped and maybe a reflector to bounce the light back onto the dress would still have left some detail for the viewer? From the bottom corner of the dress it seems like there was some nice light to be had. Hope this helps some.</td>', 'To me it seems like she is about to be caged and getting her last look at freedom. I am obviously not married LoL. IMO the sky being so blown brings the shot down. I think underexposing more to have some detail in the sky would have helped and maybe a reflector to bounce the light back onto the dress would still have left some detail for the viewer? From the bottom corner of the dress it seems like there was some nice light to be had. Hope this helps some.', '2007-07-27 06:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3942019, 560422, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like it, it as a real graphic abstract quality to it. If I had any suggestion it would be to maybe use a reflector placed low off camera to bring details to the model''s back, but it may have changed the mood so who knows. It is pretty good the way it is.</td>', 'I like it, it as a real graphic abstract quality to it. If I had any suggestion it would be to maybe use a reflector placed low off camera to bring details to the model''s back, but it may have changed the mood so who knows. It is pretty good the way it is.', '2007-07-27 06:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3942025, 559226, 65713, '<td valign="top">More contrast would have made it stronger for me but great idea!</td>', 'More contrast would have made it stronger for me but great idea!', '2007-07-27 06:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3942183, 559362, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice shot; but this is the worst title I have ever come across; what does it prove? Unfortunately the title and picture are linked forever. This should be called "touch" or "missing you" or "loneliness"- anything but a lame excuse for an attempt to meet the challenge some backdoor way. People are smarter that that- and your photo is to good to muck it up like that.</td>', 'Nice shot; but this is the worst title I have ever come across; what does it prove? Unfortunately the title and picture are linked forever. This should be called "touch" or "missing you" or "loneliness"- anything but a lame excuse for an attempt to meet the challenge some backdoor way. People are smarter that that- and your photo is to good to muck it up like that.', '2007-07-27 08:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3942190, 559050, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. I love the "Irish" feeling here. I think the background keeps it from being a perfect "ten"- perhaps a cottage in the background or a better view, less cropped. But still excelent clarity and theme. 9++++</td>', 'Excellent shot. I love the "Irish" feeling here. I think the background keeps it from being a perfect "ten"- perhaps a cottage in the background or a better view, less cropped. But still excelent clarity and theme. 9++++', '2007-07-27 09:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
