(3942206, 559090, 12611, '<td valign="top">perhaps not graphic enough, too cropped, too sterile police shot type photo- the aaction is less extreme cause we are just here to see the aftermath. We need to feel moved, and you have done that, razorblades and blood and pills. Iwould have really blown out the shot to make it high key with extreme unsharp mask, <br/> <br/>Extra points for the pinky ring.- but you should know, guys with pinky rings rarely commit suicide, and if they do, its usually with a revolver.</td>', 'perhaps not graphic enough, too cropped, too sterile police shot type photo- the aaction is less extreme cause we are just here to see the aftermath. We need to feel moved, and you have done that, razorblades and blood and pills. Iwould have really blown out the shot to make it high key with extreme unsharp mask,  Extra points for the pinky ring.- but you should know, guys with pinky rings rarely commit suicide, and if they do, its usually with a revolver.', '2007-07-27 09:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
