(3943690, 560326, 36382, '<td valign="top">This is definitely one of my faves of the challenge.  I love how the road leads off into nowhere.  The dog is so well behaved.  One thing you could do after the challenge but not in basic editing is tone down the bright fastener in her hair.  Overall, I think it is a great shot with a lot of emotion and it''s one of my top picks.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is definitely one of my faves of the challenge.  I love how the road leads off into nowhere.  The dog is so well behaved.  One thing you could do after the challenge but not in basic editing is tone down the bright fastener in her hair.  Overall, I think it is a great shot with a lot of emotion and it''s one of my top picks.  Good luck.', '2007-07-27 21:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3943693, 559363, 36382, '<td valign="top">Must''ve been some sort of show you were at.  It''s my top pick of the challenge, though.  It captures extreme emotion perfectly to me.  I love how the shutter speed is just right so that you still have the motion blur of the feet.  Congrats from me.  Hope you do well.  Plus the red color is just right.</td>', 'Must''ve been some sort of show you were at.  It''s my top pick of the challenge, though.  It captures extreme emotion perfectly to me.  I love how the shutter speed is just right so that you still have the motion blur of the feet.  Congrats from me.  Hope you do well.  Plus the red color is just right.', '2007-07-27 21:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3943708, 559417, 36382, '<td valign="top">What appeals to me most about this shot is the sketch type effect you have created.  I''ll be interested to know how you did that.</td>', 'What appeals to me most about this shot is the sketch type effect you have created.  I''ll be interested to know how you did that.', '2007-07-27 21:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3943714, 560200, 36382, '<td valign="top">I love grain.  Hope you are not being killed for it though.  I especially like how the bottle came out.  Very good.</td>', 'I love grain.  Hope you are not being killed for it though.  I especially like how the bottle came out.  Very good.', '2007-07-27 21:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3943837, 558656, 65107, '<td valign="top">The picture with the title is heart renderiing.  At first I thought is was a lifeguard shack at the beach, Wondered what extreme emotion? and then read the title, then OMG,</td>', 'The picture with the title is heart renderiing.  At first I thought is was a lifeguard shack at the beach, Wondered what extreme emotion? and then read the title, then OMG,', '2007-07-27 22:08:52.000000', NULL, 1);
