(3944042, 560317, 19311, '<td valign="top">I smell a ribbon, awesome shot. 85 f1.8 or 1.2 maybe?</td>', 'I smell a ribbon, awesome shot. 85 f1.8 or 1.2 maybe?', '2007-07-28 00:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944090, 560309, 60581, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what was the reason to put this in the challenge but it does not seems like a fit for this.</td>', 'I am not sure what was the reason to put this in the challenge but it does not seems like a fit for this.', '2007-07-28 00:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944369, 560550, 62187, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of someplace near where I used to live in Texas. Really nice composition.</td>', 'This reminds me of someplace near where I used to live in Texas. Really nice composition.', '2007-07-28 04:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944370, 559073, 66515, '<td valign="top">Wow...almost got me crying. I like it but I have to wonder why you chose the to color the plastic wrap of the flowers.</td>', 'Wow...almost got me crying. I like it but I have to wonder why you chose the to color the plastic wrap of the flowers.', '2007-07-28 04:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944371, 560200, 62187, '<td valign="top">People never like it when I use grain but I still do from time to time. Nice job and hey, it''s ok, tomorrow is another day!</td>', 'People never like it when I use grain but I still do from time to time. Nice job and hey, it''s ok, tomorrow is another day!', '2007-07-28 04:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
