(3944374, 558611, 62187, '<td valign="top">Are those aspirin? You know, they will kill people but not like they think. It''s a slow, irreversible and very painful death. Just an FYI, I know it''s just a photo. I always hate the labels but I guess we can''t show the name brand side huh?</td>', 'Are those aspirin? You know, they will kill people but not like they think. It''s a slow, irreversible and very painful death. Just an FYI, I know it''s just a photo. I always hate the labels but I guess we can''t show the name brand side huh?', '2007-07-28 04:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944376, 558656, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but where is the emotion?</td>', 'Nice shot but where is the emotion?', '2007-07-28 04:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
