(3944383, 560317, 62187, '<td valign="top">Strictly speaking on the photography level, this shot totally blows all the others away. It''s my choice for the blue.</td>', 'Strictly speaking on the photography level, this shot totally blows all the others away. It''s my choice for the blue.', '2007-07-28 04:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
