(3944499, 560200, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like everything about the shot except the sharpness. I think sharpening it this much kills the look you are after.<br/> <br/>I am enjoying the shot very much.</td>', 'I like everything about the shot except the sharpness. I think sharpening it this much kills the look you are after. I am enjoying the shot very much.', '2007-07-28 08:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
