(3944502, 558275, 81933, '<td valign="top">very fine reflection of being open to nature and a very calm expression of content</td>', 'very fine reflection of being open to nature and a very calm expression of content', '2007-07-28 08:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944601, 559050, 73321, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!</td>', 'Nice capture!', '2007-07-28 09:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944792, 559050, 79604, '<td valign="top">Spectacular! Colors, Exposure, Light, focus and composition all spot on! A refreshing photo amongst so many full of death and despair.</td>', 'Spectacular! Colors, Exposure, Light, focus and composition all spot on! A refreshing photo amongst so many full of death and despair.', '2007-07-28 12:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944794, 559399, 79604, '<td valign="top">Very strong impact. Very nicely executed.</td>', 'Very strong impact. Very nicely executed.', '2007-07-28 12:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944795, 559960, 79604, '<td valign="top">Definitely evokes strong emotion. Well done!</td>', 'Definitely evokes strong emotion. Well done!', '2007-07-28 12:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944796, 558717, 79604, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the despair photos. Glad you chose to do this in color. Wonderful play of light and shadow. Well done!</td>', 'My favorite of the despair photos. Glad you chose to do this in color. Wonderful play of light and shadow. Well done!', '2007-07-28 12:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944800, 559172, 79604, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, detail, exposure and composition.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, detail, exposure and composition.', '2007-07-28 12:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944818, 560326, 79604, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. I like the composition, colors and the feel of this photo.</td>', 'Lovely image. I like the composition, colors and the feel of this photo.', '2007-07-28 12:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944820, 558656, 79604, '<td valign="top">Beautifully executed and evokes strong emotion for me as my son is in Iraq as we speak.</td>', 'Beautifully executed and evokes strong emotion for me as my son is in Iraq as we speak.', '2007-07-28 12:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944823, 559090, 79604, '<td valign="top">Well done. I gave this a good score but may have given it top marks had it been in color. IMHO..it may have had more impact in color.</td>', 'Well done. I gave this a good score but may have given it top marks had it been in color. IMHO..it may have had more impact in color.', '2007-07-28 12:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944939, 559399, 16197, '<td valign="top">I love the idea, and concept, blood streaks are nice, not enough of a visible gap for the wound, and it seems way way to smooth.  Personally I would have liked a grittier effect with textures instead of being over smoothed as they appear.</td>', 'I love the idea, and concept, blood streaks are nice, not enough of a visible gap for the wound, and it seems way way to smooth.  Personally I would have liked a grittier effect with textures instead of being over smoothed as they appear.', '2007-07-28 13:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944945, 560321, 16197, '<td valign="top">This image really doesn''t give me love.  It looks like direct flash, which may have worked for this image if there was a much better background.  The wrinkled cloth with seam is really distracting.  Colours itself are a bit harsh, maybe something cooler in feel.</td>', 'This image really doesn''t give me love.  It looks like direct flash, which may have worked for this image if there was a much better background.  The wrinkled cloth with seam is really distracting.  Colours itself are a bit harsh, maybe something cooler in feel.', '2007-07-28 13:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944950, 560418, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but something just doesn''t hold right here.  Maybe the male model appears to being smothered.  I would assume his head to be more sideways, than nose in cleavage.  The muted colours feel flat to me.</td>', 'Nice concept, but something just doesn''t hold right here.  Maybe the male model appears to being smothered.  I would assume his head to be more sideways, than nose in cleavage.  The muted colours feel flat to me.', '2007-07-28 13:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944954, 559461, 16197, '<td valign="top">This would have been really nice, near ribbon for me, if two things happened.  It was Sharp as a tack, and not so far away..</td>', 'This would have been really nice, near ribbon for me, if two things happened.  It was Sharp as a tack, and not so far away..', '2007-07-28 13:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944958, 558667, 16197, '<td valign="top">I know the emotion from graviton type rides, however here, I don''t see any emotion.  The arms that are up appear to be holding on and not waving.  Waving would create emotion.  I like the idea, its a nice capture all around,  however the power-lines also just turn it blech.</td>', 'I know the emotion from graviton type rides, however here, I don''t see any emotion.  The arms that are up appear to be holding on and not waving.  Waving would create emotion.  I like the idea, its a nice capture all around,  however the power-lines also just turn it blech.', '2007-07-28 14:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944962, 559018, 66575, '<td valign="top">the pisture is excellent and really does convey distress.  i think better overall lighting, with some focus on sharper contrast, would have made it even better. 7</td>', 'the pisture is excellent and really does convey distress.  i think better overall lighting, with some focus on sharper contrast, would have made it even better. 7', '2007-07-28 14:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944964, 559410, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is really fun, I enjoy the colours and concept, however I think there might have been a better pose to give me a feel for extreme emotions.  Maybe jumping in the air or something more active.</td>', 'This is really fun, I enjoy the colours and concept, however I think there might have been a better pose to give me a feel for extreme emotions.  Maybe jumping in the air or something more active.', '2007-07-28 14:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944968, 560377, 66575, '<td valign="top">though i like the dynamic between the out of focs guy and the one in the foreground, it doesn''t convey much emotion.</td>', 'though i like the dynamic between the out of focs guy and the one in the foreground, it doesn''t convey much emotion.', '2007-07-28 14:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944971, 558656, 66575, '<td valign="top">great feeling of isolation.8</td>', 'great feeling of isolation.8', '2007-07-28 14:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944973, 559797, 16197, '<td valign="top">It may not be a welcome sight, however it does not give me the feelings of extreme emotions.  Maybe I have just been blunted over the years, but to me, its a gun, pull the trigger if you gonna use it or get it out of my face.  No real emotion just truth.  I think an extreme emotion would be blowing someones face off.. now thats extreme.</td>', 'It may not be a welcome sight, however it does not give me the feelings of extreme emotions.  Maybe I have just been blunted over the years, but to me, its a gun, pull the trigger if you gonna use it or get it out of my face.  No real emotion just truth.  I think an extreme emotion would be blowing someones face off.. now thats extreme.', '2007-07-28 14:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944979, 559050, 66575, '<td valign="top">very sweet and well done, though the blur is perhaps a bit too heavy on the left, just under his arm.</td>', 'very sweet and well done, though the blur is perhaps a bit too heavy on the left, just under his arm.', '2007-07-28 14:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944980, 560284, 16197, '<td valign="top">Don''t really understand the title compared to the image.  This may be an extreme sport, but the image itself doesn''t scream extreme emotion to me. specially not fear.  Maybe excitement but not fear.</td>', 'Don''t really understand the title compared to the image.  This may be an extreme sport, but the image itself doesn''t scream extreme emotion to me. specially not fear.  Maybe excitement but not fear.', '2007-07-28 14:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944985, 560409, 16197, '<td valign="top">It is a nice image and I like the one kid on the left looking.  But, I believe this is only an extreme emotion to a very small group of people.  Not everyone can relate to this image and for me it just isn''t enough.</td>', 'It is a nice image and I like the one kid on the left looking.  But, I believe this is only an extreme emotion to a very small group of people.  Not everyone can relate to this image and for me it just isn''t enough.', '2007-07-28 14:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
