(3945180, 560552, 16197, '<td valign="top">Need more junk outside, and instead of seeing the person in the window I think it would have been much more dramatic to just see stuff flying out the window.  That way you don''t even see the face of her.  Fun idea though.  Wondering if maybe having your flash more of an angle to get rid of  a couple of those extra shadows?</td>', 'Need more junk outside, and instead of seeing the person in the window I think it would have been much more dramatic to just see stuff flying out the window.  That way you don''t even see the face of her.  Fun idea though.  Wondering if maybe having your flash more of an angle to get rid of  a couple of those extra shadows?', '2007-07-28 15:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
