(3945187, 559994, 16197, '<td valign="top">Your title says one thing, but the kayaker says another.  For me, I have seen many a rider roll in the water, even in water a bit ruff as this.  For me there isn''t that emotion of panic, I guess for those not used to it there may be.  I don''t care for the near center placement and would have liked more of the river to see how dangerous it really was.</td>', 'Your title says one thing, but the kayaker says another.  For me, I have seen many a rider roll in the water, even in water a bit ruff as this.  For me there isn''t that emotion of panic, I guess for those not used to it there may be.  I don''t care for the near center placement and would have liked more of the river to see how dangerous it really was.', '2007-07-28 15:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
