(3946891, 559561, 9906, '<td valign="top">Looks to be a bit underexposed as there is a lot of detail lost in the shadows...<br/>TC</td>', 'Looks to be a bit underexposed as there is a lot of detail lost in the shadows...TC', '2007-07-29 17:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3946894, 559099, 9906, '<td valign="top">I think that you and I may have different definitions of the word faceless...  Your focal point is a little confusing to me.  Were you trying to take a shot of the scorpion or the boy looking at the scorpion?  If it was the second then your focus should have been on the boys face.  The way the focus is here looks a little awkward.<br/>TC</td>', 'I think that you and I may have different definitions of the word faceless...  Your focal point is a little confusing to me.  Were you trying to take a shot of the scorpion or the boy looking at the scorpion?  If it was the second then your focus should have been on the boys face.  The way the focus is here looks a little awkward.TC', '2007-07-29 17:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3946897, 559694, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge theme!  like the fact that you have a picture of something that happens to have a sunset in it rather than a picture of a sunset!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge theme!  like the fact that you have a picture of something that happens to have a sunset in it rather than a picture of a sunset!TC', '2007-07-29 17:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3946898, 559139, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great tones.  Seems to fit the challenge but it is a little boring...<br/>TC</td>', 'Great tones.  Seems to fit the challenge but it is a little boring...TC', '2007-07-29 17:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3946899, 560309, 9906, '<td valign="top">Why on earth would you take a fireworks shot and turn it b/w?  Never seen that done before...<br/>TC</td>', 'Why on earth would you take a fireworks shot and turn it b/w?  Never seen that done before...TC', '2007-07-29 17:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3946901, 558611, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m not big on suicide shots.  At least you have one that is tasteful.  It''s also nicely simple.  Nothing in the shot that you don''t need in the shot.<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m not big on suicide shots.  At least you have one that is tasteful.  It''s also nicely simple.  Nothing in the shot that you don''t need in the shot.TC', '2007-07-29 17:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3946903, 559363, 9906, '<td valign="top">I like how you have just enough motion blur.  Love the tones.  Too bad you couldn''t clone out the object on the stage at the right of the frame...<br/>TC</td>', 'I like how you have just enough motion blur.  Love the tones.  Too bad you couldn''t clone out the object on the stage at the right of the frame...TC', '2007-07-29 17:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3946909, 560537, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''ll give you the benefit of the faceless part of the challenge theme being meet even with all the faces.  After all it''s quite obvious what the subject of the shot is.  However, without the faces a lot of the emotion part wouldn''t really be there.  So I''m a little torn on how to vote on this one...<br/>TC</td>', 'I''ll give you the benefit of the faceless part of the challenge theme being meet even with all the faces.  After all it''s quite obvious what the subject of the shot is.  However, without the faces a lot of the emotion part wouldn''t really be there.  So I''m a little torn on how to vote on this one...TC', '2007-07-29 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3946912, 560418, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed if a bit tight at top and right.  Your colors are very muted.  I wonder what it would look like with the color boosted instead...<br/>TC</td>', 'Nicely composed if a bit tight at top and right.  Your colors are very muted.  I wonder what it would look like with the color boosted instead...TC', '2007-07-29 17:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
