(3946916, 559751, 9906, '<td valign="top">My eye is begging for detail in the model that just ain''t there.  Just the tiniest amount of fill lighting would have helped this a lot.  The red flower is a bit distracting and IMHO not necessary.  It just doesn''t add to the emotional impact of the shot.<br/>TC</td>', 'My eye is begging for detail in the model that just ain''t there.  Just the tiniest amount of fill lighting would have helped this a lot.  The red flower is a bit distracting and IMHO not necessary.  It just doesn''t add to the emotional impact of the shot.TC', '2007-07-29 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
