(3947975, 560552, 45194, '<td valign="top">Worthy entry...I don''t think you''ll score high but you gave me a laugh anyway. good job!</td>', 'Worthy entry...I don''t think you''ll score high but you gave me a laugh anyway. good job!', '2007-07-30 01:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3947989, 559987, 45194, '<td valign="top">Screw the voters who will mark you down because they hate woodies.  This gave me a good laugh.  Great job!</td>', 'Screw the voters who will mark you down because they hate woodies.  This gave me a good laugh.  Great job!', '2007-07-30 01:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3947997, 559994, 62249, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I''d like to see it with a tighter crop, less foreground water (which is lovely, but doesn''t tell the story as well as narrowing in on the boater''s hand/boat).</td>', 'Great capture. I''d like to see it with a tighter crop, less foreground water (which is lovely, but doesn''t tell the story as well as narrowing in on the boater''s hand/boat).', '2007-07-30 01:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948006, 557325, 45194, '<td valign="top">Not the best picture and there are several suicide shots but I have to say, the "I''m sorry" note is a great touch.  Makes me sad despite the fact that it isn''t the best picture. Work on your lighting...the hand has blown out highlights.  Again, great job on the note...you were close...</td>', 'Not the best picture and there are several suicide shots but I have to say, the "I''m sorry" note is a great touch.  Makes me sad despite the fact that it isn''t the best picture. Work on your lighting...the hand has blown out highlights.  Again, great job on the note...you were close...', '2007-07-30 01:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948011, 560104, 62249, '<td valign="top">Strictly speaking, this isn''t a great photo, but it''s just quirky enough to make me chuckle.</td>', 'Strictly speaking, this isn''t a great photo, but it''s just quirky enough to make me chuckle.', '2007-07-30 01:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3948023, 559960, 45194, '<td valign="top">Morbidly fascinating!  A strong contender in what I feel is a fairly weak challenge. You should do well with this despite the voters who will not like the death theme.  Great job.</td>', 'Morbidly fascinating!  A strong contender in what I feel is a fairly weak challenge. You should do well with this despite the voters who will not like the death theme.  Great job.', '2007-07-30 01:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
