(3949483, 558424, 46700, '<td valign="top">very good idea.  Execution could have been better, BW and more control over focus could have added impact.</td>', 'very good idea.  Execution could have been better, BW and more control over focus could have added impact.', '2007-07-30 11:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3949546, 559807, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very funny and also it looks very dangerous.  I like the backwards look while jumping.  Good thing he took the time to put on shoes, socks and hat but didn''t have time for pants or shirt.  I''m wondering how you got away with being on the rooftop in boxers.  The white wall is washed out and the rest of the building isn''t that interesting, but it was needed for this picture and was framed about the best you could.</td>', 'Very funny and also it looks very dangerous.  I like the backwards look while jumping.  Good thing he took the time to put on shoes, socks and hat but didn''t have time for pants or shirt.  I''m wondering how you got away with being on the rooftop in boxers.  The white wall is washed out and the rest of the building isn''t that interesting, but it was needed for this picture and was framed about the best you could.', '2007-07-30 12:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3949572, 559797, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good thing there are no bullets in the revolver, but having bullets visible would have increased the emotion.  Good composition.  When you see that your focus is on the gun barrel pointing at you.</td>', 'Good thing there are no bullets in the revolver, but having bullets visible would have increased the emotion.  Good composition.  When you see that your focus is on the gun barrel pointing at you.', '2007-07-30 12:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
