(3950003, 559751, 30049, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a nice job of processing this image and setting it up.  The backlighting adds to it as well.  One minor glitch...the dates on the headstone take away from the reality of the scene you''ve arranged.<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'You''ve done a nice job of processing this image and setting it up.  The backlighting adds to it as well.  One minor glitch...the dates on the headstone take away from the reality of the scene you''ve arranged. Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-07-30 14:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3950015, 559475, 32132, '<td valign="top">I like the "tilt" to this photo and the colors. He does seem pretty happy, but less from the "ride" than from the chance to be photographed :)</td>', 'I like the "tilt" to this photo and the colors. He does seem pretty happy, but less from the "ride" than from the chance to be photographed :)', '2007-07-30 14:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3950017, 559050, 32132, '<td valign="top">cute &amp; nostalgic.</td>', 'cute & nostalgic.', '2007-07-30 14:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3950029, 560543, 32132, '<td valign="top">I like your style, the photo is a little on the cool side (color tone) for me, the greens are sort of blue/green and the skin tone is, well, dead? Unless it was intentional, then disreguard my opinion :)</td>', 'I like your style, the photo is a little on the cool side (color tone) for me, the greens are sort of blue/green and the skin tone is, well, dead? Unless it was intentional, then disreguard my opinion :)', '2007-07-30 14:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3950041, 560418, 32132, '<td valign="top">provocative and maybe the cool tone is intentional, but I would have scored higher if it was warmer, would have "heated" up the emotion. It seems like the color is unnatural on her hair...but I like the composition a lot.</td>', 'provocative and maybe the cool tone is intentional, but I would have scored higher if it was warmer, would have "heated" up the emotion. It seems like the color is unnatural on her hair...but I like the composition a lot.', '2007-07-30 14:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3950050, 560221, 32132, '<td valign="top">love the motion! contrast excellent, I like this photo very much. Well done! I can feel it!</td>', 'love the motion! contrast excellent, I like this photo very much. Well done! I can feel it!', '2007-07-30 14:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3950059, 559475, 32345, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I just don''t understand the Faceless Emotion in this picture.</td>', 'Sorry but I just don''t understand the Faceless Emotion in this picture.', '2007-07-30 14:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3950068, 557325, 32132, '<td valign="top">I just don''t like the way the arm &amp; hand are blown out at the top, and the green tint to the thumb nail. I like to see the effort at a good set up though!!</td>', 'I just don''t like the way the arm & hand are blown out at the top, and the green tint to the thumb nail. I like to see the effort at a good set up though!!', '2007-07-30 14:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3950079, 560277, 32132, '<td valign="top">Oh geez, where''s he going to land? Water I''m guessing. Good shot, the sky has some noise in it, but the shutter speed rules a shot like this!!The guy seems a bit dark, but overall pretty good!</td>', 'Oh geez, where''s he going to land? Water I''m guessing. Good shot, the sky has some noise in it, but the shutter speed rules a shot like this!!The guy seems a bit dark, but overall pretty good!', '2007-07-30 14:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3950083, 560366, 32132, '<td valign="top">It is great how you applied the lighting as a major feature here. I feel it.</td>', 'It is great how you applied the lighting as a major feature here. I feel it.', '2007-07-30 14:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3950097, 559362, 32132, '<td valign="top">I think it needs to be a more beautiful image of a hand to express the emotion the title is talling about. This is more of a "horror" shot for me, like "HELP !!!! HE IS GOING TO KILL ME WITH A CHAINSAW!!!!" I''ve said this too much I know, but if the tone had been warm instead of cool IMO it would have been...i don''t know, more nice.</td>', 'I think it needs to be a more beautiful image of a hand to express the emotion the title is talling about. This is more of a "horror" shot for me, like "HELP !!!! HE IS GOING TO KILL ME WITH A CHAINSAW!!!!" I''ve said this too much I know, but if the tone had been warm instead of cool IMO it would have been...i don''t know, more nice.', '2007-07-30 14:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3950098, 559050, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  Hope to see this on the front page at rollover.  Besides the fact that the image is well executed (lighting, focus, etc...) it also tells a story that fits the challenge WITHOUT having to sell it with a title.<br/> <br/>Congrats in advance.  :D</td>', 'Nicely done!  Hope to see this on the front page at rollover.  Besides the fact that the image is well executed (lighting, focus, etc...) it also tells a story that fits the challenge WITHOUT having to sell it with a title. Congrats in advance.  :D', '2007-07-30 14:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
