(3950146, 559270, 30049, '<td valign="top">Of all the images using this theme (or something similar) I kind of like this.  Not sure what you could''ve done differently, but the fence in the bg is a little distracting.  Seems sincere, although I have to question whether this is a setup or not as the tombstone seems quite aged...long-term mourning perhaps?</td>', 'Of all the images using this theme (or something similar) I kind of like this.  Not sure what you could''ve done differently, but the fence in the bg is a little distracting.  Seems sincere, although I have to question whether this is a setup or not as the tombstone seems quite aged...long-term mourning perhaps?', '2007-07-30 15:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3950174, 560324, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, however, what is extremely emotive about it?  Not trying to be difficult, just trying to understand.  I''ll have to come back after the challenge is over to see if there''s any enlightening details.  :)<br/> <br/>The photo is nicely put together.  Well focused and overall composed with the main subject positioned in an engaging manner.  You wouldn''t have lost anything to crop this some off the top to lose the washed out sky.  Actually I think it would improve the photo by eliminating that bright distraction.  JMO of course.  :)<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, however, what is extremely emotive about it?  Not trying to be difficult, just trying to understand.  I''ll have to come back after the challenge is over to see if there''s any enlightening details.  :) The photo is nicely put together.  Well focused and overall composed with the main subject positioned in an engaging manner.  You wouldn''t have lost anything to crop this some off the top to lose the washed out sky.  Actually I think it would improve the photo by eliminating that bright distraction.  JMO of course.  :) Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-07-30 15:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
