(3950185, 560307, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, but I''m not seeing much in the way of extreme emotion.  If I look at her face I sense peace and meditative reflection (but we''re not supposed to need a face for the emotive part of this).  Hmmm.  Perhaps there''s something deeper here that''s not obvious.  Sorry if I missed it.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely image, but I''m not seeing much in the way of extreme emotion.  If I look at her face I sense peace and meditative reflection (but we''re not supposed to need a face for the emotive part of this).  Hmmm.  Perhaps there''s something deeper here that''s not obvious.  Sorry if I missed it.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-07-30 15:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
