(3950261, 558611, 32132, '<td valign="top">The color mood is great, and the lighting is okay too, what prevents it from being great for me is the composition. The hand coming out of the head...he doesn''t seem to be lying his head on the hand so the perspective is off. The dark at the bottom isn''t identifiable--assuming it is a shoulder...I would have liked his posture to be featured more prominently instead of the objects.</td>', 'The color mood is great, and the lighting is okay too, what prevents it from being great for me is the composition. The hand coming out of the head...he doesn''t seem to be lying his head on the hand so the perspective is off. The dark at the bottom isn''t identifiable--assuming it is a shoulder...I would have liked his posture to be featured more prominently instead of the objects.', '2007-07-30 15:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
