(3950283, 560377, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Tom.  Something about Tom is extremely emotive here...  I know, the dude that''s OOF wishes he had a smoke?  No, that can''t be it.  Nothing extremely emotive about that, unless the guy''s trying to quit.  Wait, oh no - you''re not insinuating the dude in the back has a thing for Tom are you?  Well, I guess that could be extreme, a major yuck factor, but certainly emotive.<br/> <br/>From a technical standpoint the image is well done.  Good use of DOF to isolate the guy in front yet leave enough detail in the bg to recognize it.  The range in the B/W is well balanced covering the full scale.<br/> <br/>Definitely an image that makes the viewer wonder I guess.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm.  Tom.  Something about Tom is extremely emotive here...  I know, the dude that''s OOF wishes he had a smoke?  No, that can''t be it.  Nothing extremely emotive about that, unless the guy''s trying to quit.  Wait, oh no - you''re not insinuating the dude in the back has a thing for Tom are you?  Well, I guess that could be extreme, a major yuck factor, but certainly emotive. From a technical standpoint the image is well done.  Good use of DOF to isolate the guy in front yet leave enough detail in the bg to recognize it.  The range in the B/W is well balanced covering the full scale. Definitely an image that makes the viewer wonder I guess.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-07-30 15:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3950290, 560200, 32132, '<td valign="top">Decisions, decisions, guess he opted out on the razor blade. I like the grain, the posture, and the tatoos, this would have been my favorite of the numerous suicide images if there just weren''t so many objects. I would have voted up a point if there was just a bottle of booze, it''s cap, and pill bottle on the left and it''s cap.</td>', 'Decisions, decisions, guess he opted out on the razor blade. I like the grain, the posture, and the tatoos, this would have been my favorite of the numerous suicide images if there just weren''t so many objects. I would have voted up a point if there was just a bottle of booze, it''s cap, and pill bottle on the left and it''s cap.', '2007-07-30 15:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3950291, 558424, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice display of emotion through a hand in a hospital bed.  Good DOF.  I see the bedding is being grasped, which displays extreme pain well.  I sincerely hope this was staged.  I was going to comment on not seeing stress in the muscles/tendons, but trying it myself it''s hard to tell the difference between gentle grasping and extreme tension.</td>', 'Nice display of emotion through a hand in a hospital bed.  Good DOF.  I see the bedding is being grasped, which displays extreme pain well.  I sincerely hope this was staged.  I was going to comment on not seeing stress in the muscles/tendons, but trying it myself it''s hard to tell the difference between gentle grasping and extreme tension.', '2007-07-30 15:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
