(3950378, 559411, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  I was thinking it was excellent handling of a reflection but further investigation shows it''s plexiglass.  The faceless emotion is very evident here.  The shadows on the arms are unfortunate.  Looking at the names, are you <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=71186" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">thearendts</a> Jon Arendt?  A little hint, don''t PM me back now so you retain what anonymity you still have.  8</td>', 'Very well done.  I was thinking it was excellent handling of a reflection but further investigation shows it''s plexiglass.  The faceless emotion is very evident here.  The shadows on the arms are unfortunate.  Looking at the names, are you  thearendts Jon Arendt?  A little hint, don''t PM me back now so you retain what anonymity you still have.  8', '2007-07-30 16:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
