(3950398, 559879, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure what to make of this as far as the meaning.  I definitely see the emotion portrayed, but was the guy in the picture just murdered?  Did his scorned lover commit suicide?  Why the red rose, and why is the knife tip just a tiny bit embedded in the photo?  A title would help.  All I can think is it''s some psychotic killer''s strange MO.  Blood further up the knife blade would indicate deadly penetration.  Technically a very good picture.  8</td>', 'I''m not quite sure what to make of this as far as the meaning.  I definitely see the emotion portrayed, but was the guy in the picture just murdered?  Did his scorned lover commit suicide?  Why the red rose, and why is the knife tip just a tiny bit embedded in the photo?  A title would help.  All I can think is it''s some psychotic killer''s strange MO.  Blood further up the knife blade would indicate deadly penetration.  Technically a very good picture.  8', '2007-07-30 16:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
