(3950609, 559879, 32132, '<td valign="top">Colors are vibrant and it really pops, there is something off for me though in the way the objects are lined up. To get the emotion of what you are going for I would need to "believe" something terrible has happened here...and thing are just to obviously placed. I like that you used a b&amp;w photo and the textures come through nicely also.</td>', 'Colors are vibrant and it really pops, there is something off for me though in the way the objects are lined up. To get the emotion of what you are going for I would need to "believe" something terrible has happened here...and thing are just to obviously placed. I like that you used a b&w photo and the textures come through nicely also.', '2007-07-30 17:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
