(3950616, 558424, 32132, '<td valign="top">Yes! I like when a cool tone works perfectly in an image!! I like the depth of field and composition, well done. I like that the grip isn''t overdone, I feel his pain! This one has the qualities I would want for an image to do well in it''s challenge! one tiny question...why is his forearm so hairy but not his upper arm?</td>', 'Yes! I like when a cool tone works perfectly in an image!! I like the depth of field and composition, well done. I like that the grip isn''t overdone, I feel his pain! This one has the qualities I would want for an image to do well in it''s challenge! one tiny question...why is his forearm so hairy but not his upper arm?', '2007-07-30 17:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3950617, 560552, 77365, '<td valign="top">Have you seen any of Julie Blackmon photos because these are not any where near hers. However you are at least on task with the assignment. The flash is uneven and the man in the window does not look like a women however if you showed a lady and her lover throwing your crap out the window then you might have a prize in the making. Again the flash messed up the whole job can we shoot this over. Cut. A for effort.</td>', 'Have you seen any of Julie Blackmon photos because these are not any where near hers. However you are at least on task with the assignment. The flash is uneven and the man in the window does not look like a women however if you showed a lady and her lover throwing your crap out the window then you might have a prize in the making. Again the flash messed up the whole job can we shoot this over. Cut. A for effort.', '2007-07-30 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
