(3951847, 560538, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good image overall and a good use of selective desaturation. However, the sadness isn''t conveyed as well as some of the other images in this challenge involving pills. Good shot, nonetheless.</td>', 'Good image overall and a good use of selective desaturation. However, the sadness isn''t conveyed as well as some of the other images in this challenge involving pills. Good shot, nonetheless.', '2007-07-31 00:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
