(3951856, 558656, 57032, '<td valign="top">A good shot with a beautiful sky. The title of this image saves it a bit, as it would be hard to guess the soldier''s emotion without an understanding of current events. Good capture.</td>', 'A good shot with a beautiful sky. The title of this image saves it a bit, as it would be hard to guess the soldier''s emotion without an understanding of current events. Good capture.', '2007-07-31 00:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
