(3951896, 559716, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great timing! Contrast is a bit flat in the background and the highlights are blown out in the sky, but the shot that was captured boosts this image back up.</td>', 'Great timing! Contrast is a bit flat in the background and the highlights are blown out in the sky, but the shot that was captured boosts this image back up.', '2007-07-31 00:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
