(3955110, 560324, 43410, '<td valign="top">yeah, i completely screwed this one, but i love the shot.  <br/> <br/>ya live ya learn.  i have to get better at symbolism, and portraying it in my photos in these types of challenges.<br/> <br/>thanks for all the great comments.  they all mean a lot to me, every last one of them.<br/> <br/>sorry for the one day in the forumns when i was a jerk for a post griping, the time taken to open my eyes on this one is greatly appreciated.  i had a bad day :D<br/> <br/>thanks again :D</td>', 'yeah, i completely screwed this one, but i love the shot.   ya live ya learn.  i have to get better at symbolism, and portraying it in my photos in these types of challenges. thanks for all the great comments.  they all mean a lot to me, every last one of them. sorry for the one day in the forumns when i was a jerk for a post griping, the time taken to open my eyes on this one is greatly appreciated.  i had a bad day :D thanks again :D', '2007-08-01 01:16:23.000000', NULL, 0),
