(3956855, 560272, 80912, '<td valign="top">OK, a little explanation. My "extreme" was to think of one of the worst things that could happen to a person. And that would be for it to be as if you never existed - to be totally forgotten.<br/> <br/>I intentionally went for grainy (upped the film speed even though it was a dark spot on a rainy day), which apparently translated to "blurry" for some. I wasn''t too happy that the tombstone was so blown out, but I thought it emphasized the "forgotten-ness" so didn''t work too hard on fixing it.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the comments. And 3 10s, wow!</td>', 'OK, a little explanation. My "extreme" was to think of one of the worst things that could happen to a person. And that would be for it to be as if you never existed - to be totally forgotten. I intentionally went for grainy (upped the film speed even though it was a dark spot on a rainy day), which apparently translated to "blurry" for some. I wasn''t too happy that the tombstone was so blown out, but I thought it emphasized the "forgotten-ness" so didn''t work too hard on fixing it. Thanks for all the comments. And 3 10s, wow!', '2007-08-01 10:55:59.000000', NULL, 0),
