(3961373, 559411, 75510, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by littlegett:</b></div><hr/><i> I don''t understand the title to the image, I don''t know where the people are, but all I can assume is they are paying respects to someone passed.  For me, I guess I had to be there, cause it doesn''t really hold strong emotion over me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hope you undestand now that this was a plane accident.</td>', 'Originally posted by littlegett: I don''t understand the title to the image, I don''t know where the people are, but all I can assume is they are paying respects to someone passed.  For me, I guess I had to be there, cause it doesn''t really hold strong emotion over me.  Hope you undestand now that this was a plane accident.', '2007-08-02 12:00:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3961408, 559050, 56744, '<td valign="top">Jason,<br/>Thanks for sharing with this wonderful community the behind the scenes" of this photo. Usually the winners only give explanations about post-processing techniques, but you decided to explain all the process. I applaud that. If my English was enough I would be doing the same thing giving return to all of these people which Ive been learning so much.<br/> <br/>Im glad this photo did so well! Congrats!<br/></td>', 'Jason,Thanks for sharing with this wonderful community the behind the scenes" of this photo. Usually the winners only give explanations about post-processing techniques, but you decided to explain all the process. I applaud that. If my English was enough I would be doing the same thing giving return to all of these people which Ive been learning so much. Im glad this photo did so well! Congrats!', '2007-08-02 12:09:27.000000', NULL, 0),
