(3973622, 559879, 67697, '<td valign="top">The blood is such a pretty red (heh)<br/>I see the author''s pic. So you didn''t like his last book?  (heh)<br/>lol and the napkin is for....  cleanup?<br/> <br/>Did you notice the tinge of blue in his hair?  That is kind of interesting.<br/> <br/>Last but not least - you got some seriously interesting thought provoking comments.  THAT is a sign of a work of art...</td>', 'The blood is such a pretty red (heh)I see the author''s pic. So you didn''t like his last book?  (heh)lol and the napkin is for....  cleanup? Did you notice the tinge of blue in his hair?  That is kind of interesting. Last but not least - you got some seriously interesting thought provoking comments.  THAT is a sign of a work of art...', '2007-08-06 10:29:45.000000', NULL, 0),
