(3995620, 559399, 74979, '<td valign="top">ouch!  packs a wallop of emotion-"in your face". Very strong.  great image, very well done.  I didn''t vote in this challenge, so didn''t see it until the thumbnail was flitting about in browse section;  Ben this is very different for you!  WOW! If you want to talk about scoring, look at the avg score for commenters!  great!  my guess is, this image was a bit raw for a lot of folks, definitely Extreme emotion!!<br/> <br/>strong work!<br/>Anni</td>', 'ouch!  packs a wallop of emotion-"in your face". Very strong.  great image, very well done.  I didn''t vote in this challenge, so didn''t see it until the thumbnail was flitting about in browse section;  Ben this is very different for you!  WOW! If you want to talk about scoring, look at the avg score for commenters!  great!  my guess is, this image was a bit raw for a lot of folks, definitely Extreme emotion!! strong work!Anni', '2007-08-13 23:56:21.000000', NULL, 0),
