(4341315, 559399, 69325, '<td valign="top">hmmm i gave this a 6 during voting but i think its mostly because it looks like it was neat image''d to death. or whatever your tool of choice is (noise ninja/kodak air brush) but the drop is perfect and as a not pick i think i would have had the wrist turned up slightly more so we could not so plainly see that there is no cut mark, not that i would expect you to go to such lengths for your art! ;)</td>', 'hmmm i gave this a 6 during voting but i think its mostly because it looks like it was neat image''d to death. or whatever your tool of choice is (noise ninja/kodak air brush) but the drop is perfect and as a not pick i think i would have had the wrist turned up slightly more so we could not so plainly see that there is no cut mark, not that i would expect you to go to such lengths for your art! ;)', '2007-12-28 15:32:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4349505, 559399, 87470, '<td valign="top">it doesn''t look credible.. in the first place, suicides like these are by cutting an artery on the wrist that is a little higher than what is shown in the photo, next when the artery is cut, the blood gushes out in full force,, doesn''t trickle as appears in the photo, and is fresh blood of bright color,  and if the photo is supposed to have been some time after the death .. then the blood would look caked and not like chocolate sauce .. and the hand would appear pale and lifeless.. not fresh and full of blood as appears there .. no sir, you cant do this kind of photo composing, which is providential !</td>', 'it doesn''t look credible.. in the first place, suicides like these are by cutting an artery on the wrist that is a little higher than what is shown in the photo, next when the artery is cut, the blood gushes out in full force,, doesn''t trickle as appears in the photo, and is fresh blood of bright color,  and if the photo is supposed to have been some time after the death .. then the blood would look caked and not like chocolate sauce .. and the hand would appear pale and lifeless.. not fresh and full of blood as appears there .. no sir, you cant do this kind of photo composing, which is providential !', '2008-01-01 09:03:48.000000', NULL, 0),
