(4492696, 559229, 73452, '<td valign="top">I think this would look awesome in b/w, along with some contrast work, and the grain is a little distracting, but it is a great subject for the challenge, I certainly think it should have scored better.</td>', 'I think this would look awesome in b/w, along with some contrast work, and the grain is a little distracting, but it is a great subject for the challenge, I certainly think it should have scored better.', '2008-02-17 15:34:59.000000', NULL, 0),
