(4729270, 559050, 30807, '<td valign="top">I really like the effort you seem to put in to all you do! Lovely shot!<br/> <br/>I imagine you have a happy married and family life, somehow, as you seem to have such good principles - I like the inclusion of the motto about being a fabulous and wonderful (not exact words, but the feeling''s that)from the clinic. I cannot imagine you being a failure,but success in all in life. <br/> <br/>I am sure that you will go far in your photography too - I found it hard to imagine taking all that many shots to get the right one, but it has obviously paid off - persistence pays! <br/> <br/>I wish I was more like you myself - you have inspired me to try harder in my own life. I wish you all the best in everything, and look forward to seeing more of your photographic work.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I really like the effort you seem to put in to all you do! Lovely shot! I imagine you have a happy married and family life, somehow, as you seem to have such good principles - I like the inclusion of the motto about being a fabulous and wonderful (not exact words, but the feeling''s that)from the clinic. I cannot imagine you being a failure,but success in all in life.  I am sure that you will go far in your photography too - I found it hard to imagine taking all that many shots to get the right one, but it has obviously paid off - persistence pays!  I wish I was more like you myself - you have inspired me to try harder in my own life. I wish you all the best in everything, and look forward to seeing more of your photographic work. ', '2008-05-28 07:33:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4905485, 559050, 56744, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t stop smiling when I saw this<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=710072" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/904/120/710072.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/904/120/710072.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/904/120/710072.jpg"/></a> at the front page. <br/>Great old times Jason! I really miss you and the team...<br/>PS: It was a kind and funny homage from william88 to your work.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I couldn''t stop smiling when I saw this at the front page. Great old times Jason! I really miss you and the team...PS: It was a kind and funny homage from william88 to your work. ', '2008-08-23 01:19:13.000000', NULL, 0),
